\ **************************************************************************
\ *
\ *    The decompressor: ZX02
\ *
\ *    A port of dmsc's zx02-optim.asm, the size- and speed-optimised 6502
\ *    decoder from https://github.com/dmsc/zx02. Its zero page comes from
\ *    the allocator, and the caller sets src and dst instead of copying in
\ *    an initialisation block; the rest is dmsc's code as written.
\ *
\ *    The original carries "(c) 2022 DMSC, code under MIT license", and
\ *    its LICENSE file reads:
